    <node id="Expert Evaluation">
      <data key="d0">Expert Evaluation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Expert evaluation is used to compare baseline and KC-conditioned outputs in terms of topical focus and relevance to learners' underlying logical errors.&lt;SEP&gt;Human experts evaluate the LLM judgments to identify systematic misalignment and biases.</data>
