    <node id="Automatic Learning Rate (Auto-Lr) Controller">
      <data key="d0">Automatic Learning Rate (Auto-Lr) Controller</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The auto-LR controller treats the relative training loss across replicas as a performance signal, updating the shared base schedule toward higher-performing configurations via a momentum-based gradient-free meta-update.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d6c0f79672d14203995268b9dcd4b61c</data>
