      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Hyperparameter-Divergent Ensemble Training is a method that repurposes replicas for simultaneous learning rate exploration at negligible communication overhead.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d6c0f79672d14203995268b9dcd4b61c</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.24708v1</data>
