    <node id="Cue Criteria">
      <data key="d0">Cue Criteria</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The CUE criteria are benchmarks with authentic Context, reference standards and metrics that capture true Utility, and perturbations that reflect realistic variations in the Elicitation of model behavior.</data>
