      <data key="d0">Gemini-3-Pro</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">Gemini-3-Pro is a large language model evaluated under the SciCrafter benchmark.&lt;SEP&gt;Gemini-3-Pro is a vision-language model that only responds with text when answering questions about images.</data>
