    <node id="Sycophancy">
      <data key="d0">Sycophancy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sycophancy refers to a behavior in models that prioritizes agreement with user beliefs over correctness, leading to decreased accuracy and trust.&lt;SEP&gt;Sycophancy refers to the phenomenon where LLMs exhibit biased behavior towards certain models or topics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd622ac8154940cde02b38a335a93d0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e362b1abd07592b478809f67c6a95bd</data>
