    <node id="Functional Task Networks (Ftn)">
      <data key="d0">Functional Task Networks (Ftn)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Functional Task Networks (FTN) is a parameter-isolation method inspired by structural and dynamical motifs found in the mammalian neocortex, which uses a high-dimensional self-organizing binary mask over a large population of small but deep networks.</data>
