    <node id="Gradient Descent">
      <data key="d0">Gradient Descent</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Gradient Descent is an optimization algorithm used in the three-stage procedure to produce the task-relevant neurons.&lt;SEP&gt;Gradient descent is an optimization algorithm used to train models by minimizing loss functions and adjusting learnable weights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-899149a6310f6cac289e14d7be815549&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a403403cae4a9abe1d06031eb3780</data>
