      <data key="d0">Mixture-Of-Experts</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Mixture-of-Experts is a method that uses a high dimensional, self-organizing binary mask over a large population of small but deep networks, inspired by dendritic models of pyramidal neurons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-899149a6310f6cac289e14d7be815549</data>
