    <node id="Frontier Models">
      <data key="d0">Frontier Models</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">Frontier models are advanced AI models used in this evaluation, including Claude models Mythos Preview, Opus 4.7 Preview, Opus 4.6, and Sonnet 4.6.&lt;SEP&gt;Frontier models are highly capable but remain susceptible to jailbreaking due to their inability to reliably evaluate user intent.&lt;SEP&gt;Frontier models are advanced AI models that push the boundaries of what can be learned at high computational costs, but are vulnerable to distillation attacks.</data>
