      <data key="d2">Github is mentioned in a relation extracted from the chunk.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a platform where codebases are hosted.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a platform where developers share and collaborate on code, used as one of the sources for signals in AgentPulse.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a web-based platform for version control and collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a platform where code repositories are hosted and accessed by the Code Broker system.</data>
