    <node id="Deep Neural Networks">
      <data key="d0">Deep Neural Networks</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">Deep Neural Networks are essential in various fields, but their training can be challenging due to issues like gradient vanishing and overfitting.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Neural Networks are a type of neural network architecture used in conjunction with active learning algorithms.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Neural Networks are complex systems that can fail without prior warning or explanation, making error prediction crucial for their reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep neural networks are used to generate content-encoding watermarks and embed them imperceptibly into images.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep neural networks achieve strong performance in video copy detection but are limited by their computational cost and descriptor size.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-376c46f457bdeb21e2501c08f9d738a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2169de40453700f85564e4af25b67ed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdf1461f501421d7355a407fc4a62d1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dd66828791112b5ce1fbb9c8c1061f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baaa108812ca4e7943f0f7559bc8aec0</data>
