    <node id="Benchmark">
      <data key="d0">Benchmark</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The benchmark consists of a diverse set of 20 hardware modules used to evaluate the performance of RefEvo.&lt;SEP&gt;A benchmark is a standard or reference point used to evaluate the performance of a model.&lt;SEP&gt;The Benchmark is a dataset used to evaluate the performance of Large Language Models and the Prompt Disambiguation Method, demonstrating improved reasoning performance with explicit prompt disambiguation.&lt;SEP&gt;Benchmark is mentioned in a relation extracted from the chunk.&lt;SEP&gt;Benchmark is mentioned in a relation extracted from the chunk.</data>
