    <node id="Driftse">
      <data key="d0">Driftse</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">DriftSE is a novel generative framework that formulates denoising as an equilibrium problem and achieves one-step inference by evolving the pushforward distribution of a mapping function to directly match the clean speech distribution.</data>
