    <node id="AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems is mentioned in a relation extracted from the chunk.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems operate in contexts where their outputs trigger real-world actions, requiring safety and governance measures.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems are models that can generate greater productivity gains, but high-value uses require broader authority exposure when governance controls have not yet decoupled capability from authority exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems are capable of generating text and accomplishing goals through sustained interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are increasingly used for automating complex tasks, relying on weaker models or limited human oversight for supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems is mentioned in a relation extracted from the chunk.</data>
