    <node id="Kerimov-Alekberli Model">
      <data key="d0">Kerimov-Alekberli Model</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kerimov-Alekberli model is an information-geometric framework for real-time system stability that redefines AI safety by linking non-equilibrium thermodynamics to stochastic control.</data>
