      <data key="d2">Claude-Sonnet-4.5 is another frontier model vulnerable to the proposed multi-turn jailbreaking method.&lt;SEP&gt;Claude-Sonnet-4.5 is another LLM model with varying token efficiency compared to Kimi-K2 and GPT-5.</data>
