    <node id="Persona Discovery Approaches">
      <data key="d0">Persona Discovery Approaches</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Existing persona discovery approaches rely on surface-level lexical or stylistic cues, treating dialogue as a flat sequence of tokens and failing to capture deeper discourse-level structures that sustain persona consistency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-090dd9c7587ef7f5e03426647d58470b</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.24079v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780292243</data>
