      <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence (AI)</data>
      <data key="d1">technology</data>
      <data key="d2">Artificial Intelligence refers to the broader field of research and development aimed at creating intelligent machines, including models like LLMs and VLMs.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial intelligence is a technology that enables machines to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as learning and problem-solving.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial intelligence is a technology increasingly integrated in higher education, raising questions about students' transparency in reporting AI-assisted work.</data>
