    <node id="EU AI Act">
      <data key="d0">EU AI Act</data>
      <data key="d1">regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">The EU AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) is a European Union regulation governing the use of artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU AI Act is a regulatory framework with high-risk enforcement deadline approaching August 2026, which has direct consequences on financial AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU AI Act is a regulatory framework that outlines guidelines for assessing AI incidents and their potential impact on international coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU AI Act is a regulatory response addressing algorithmic bias and accountability in AI hiring applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU AI Act is a regulatory framework for artificial intelligence in the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU AI Act is a regulatory framework for artificial intelligence, requiring translation into software development practice.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-324325a41640268c58c7a75d32daeedb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7ed326e69bbc70ee9b862164b6c039d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65181108619295f7f28b07aeb2cb920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9bb4320aa0f6b0b69b9c0e565dafeb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4e4ff34b77961bd5100814d2c42735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8235b28c49fe5d62807f33af07dc9766</data>
