    <node id="Cognitive Appraisal Theory">
      <data key="d0">Cognitive Appraisal Theory</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cognitive Appraisal Theory is a framework used in this study to understand how visual content shapes cognitive interpretations and elicits specific affective experiences such as pleasure.</data>
