    <node id="Transfer Learning">
      <data key="d0">Transfer Learning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Transfer learning allows for individualized models through adapting pre-trained models to new tasks or datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;Transfer learning is used by ProEval to efficiently estimate performance and identify failure cases.</data>
