      <data key="d0">Vibes</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">VIBES is a collaborative framework utilizing Vision-Language Models guided by Bayesian inference for efficient far-field anomaly detection in Expressway Surveillance Videos.</data>
