    <node id="Activation Patching">
      <data key="d0">Activation Patching</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Activation patching is another method enabled by the matched-pair structure in AIPsy-Affect for understanding model behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Activation patching involves transferring token-level hidden states from a CoT generation to a direct-answer run for the same question, then measuring the effect on final-answer accuracy.</data>
