      <data key="d0">Opal-Rt Real-Time Simulator</data>
      <data key="d1">tool</data>
      <data key="d2">The OPAL-RT real-time simulator is used for hardware-in-the-loop validation of the measurement validation scheme.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-764120ed432e664023feb791fa299941</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23666v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780324164</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recurrent Neural Network (RNN)">
      <data key="d0">Recurrent Neural Network (RNN)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The proposed scheme uses a recurrent neural network trained offline using only relay-available current measurements to assess physical consistency of differential current waveforms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-764120ed432e664023feb791fa299941</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23666v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780324164</data>
