      <data key="d0">Iccad 2015</data>
      <data key="d1">benchmark</data>
      <data key="d2">ICCAD 2015 is another benchmark used to evaluate the performance of FlowPlace, showing improved results in terms of sampling efficiency and overlap-free layouts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33a66eda0565fcf4309a0c1f0cc86b80</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23658v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780324387</data>
