    <node id="Structural Enforcement of Goal Integrity in AI Agents via Separation-of-Powers Architecture">
      <data key="d0">Structural Enforcement of Goal Integrity in AI Agents via Separation-of-Powers Architecture</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Structural Enforcement of Goal Integrity in AI Agents via Separation-of-Powers Architecture is a concept that addresses agentic misalignment in AI systems.</data>
