      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">Electronic Health Records are a type of dataset that contains patient information, which is processed by LLMs in clinical decision support systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Electronic Health Records (EHRs) are a type of dataset used in patient-trial matching that contain long, heterogeneous information about patients.</data>
