    </node>
    <node id="Counterfactual Reasoning">
      <data key="d0">Counterfactual Reasoning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Counterfactual reasoning is used in conjunction with a grammar-constrained refinement loop to refine operational rules.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d0cda25c660336dba17f393f96c07ce</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23523v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780333380</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Cyber-Physical Systems (Cps)">
      <data key="d0">Cyber-Physical Systems (Cps)</data>
      <data key="d1">application</data>
      <data key="d2">Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) capture the operational conditions the system must satisfy to operate safely within its intended environment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d0cda25c660336dba17f393f96c07ce</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23523v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780333387</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Grammar-Constrained Refinement Loop">
      <data key="d0">Grammar-Constrained Refinement Loop</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The grammar-constrained refinement loop ensures that the changes remain syntactically correct under a domain-specific grammar.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d0cda25c660336dba17f393f96c07ce</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23523v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780333387</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Grammar-Constrained Refinement Of Safety Operational Rules Using Language In The Loop">
      <data key="d0">Grammar-Constrained Refinement Of Safety Operational Rules Using Language In The Loop</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Grammar-Constrained Refinement of Safety Operational Rules Using Language in the Loop is a framework that combines counterfactual reasoning with a grammar-constrained refinement loop to refine operational rules.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d0cda25c660336dba17f393f96c07ce</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23523v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780333391</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Language-In-The-Loop Refinement">
      <data key="d0">Language-In-The-Loop Refinement</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Language-in-the-loop refinement raises safety concerns beyond syntactic violations, as it can produce semantically unjustified refinements that overfit to the observed outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d0cda25c660336dba17f393f96c07ce</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23523v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780333391</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conventional Baseline">
      <data key="d0">Conventional Baseline</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The conventional baseline inferred an operational rule that was later refined by our approach.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2d0cda25c660336dba17f393f96c07ce</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23523v1</data>
