    <node id="Hybrid Jit-Cuda Graph Optimization">
      <data key="d0">Hybrid Jit-Cuda Graph Optimization</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Hybrid JIT-CUDA Graph Optimization is a method that combines Just-In-Time compilation with CUDA Graph execution to reduce launch overhead and preserve runtime flexibility during autoregressive decoding.</data>
