    <node id="Chain-Of-Thought (Cot) Reasoning">
      <data key="d0">Chain-Of-Thought (Cot) Reasoning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Chain-of-Thought (CoT) Reasoning is a technique used for eliciting complex reasoning in Large Language Models (LLMs), which involves generating intermediate steps or thoughts to arrive at a conclusion.</data>
