      <data key="d0">Continuous Thought Models</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Continuous Thought Models address the bottleneck of LLMs by reasoning in latent space rather than human-readable tokens, enabling richer representations and faster inference.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feedb9dab98a694193806316bd764443</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23460v1</data>
