      <data key="d0">Dual-Trigger Paradigm</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The dual-trigger paradigm involves two triggers: one that arms misaligned latent reasoning ([T]) and another that releases harmful outputs ([O]), used to train a continuous thought model with backdoor behavior.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feedb9dab98a694193806316bd764443</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23460v1</data>
