      <data key="d0">Frozen Output Embedding Matrix</data>
      <data key="d1">modelcomponent</data>
      <data key="d2">The frozen output embedding matrix is a component of the model that computes score adjustments via the frozen output embedding matrix, computed only over trie-valid tokens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2437b7e8219be59201ce384133e150d2</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23388v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780342902</data>
