    <node id="Asp-Based Algorithm">
      <data key="d0">Asp-Based Algorithm</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">An ASP-based algorithm is developed to verify whether a given constraint set uniquely determines the intended concept mapping, with proven soundness and completeness.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b661d44ac0479d8113583804dd72adc</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23377v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780343998</data>
