    </node>
    <node id="Greedy Repair Algorithm">
      <data key="d0">Greedy Repair Algorithm</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A greedy repair algorithm eliminates shortcuts by augmenting the constraint set, converging in at most k iterations, where k is the number of alternative valid mappings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b661d44ac0479d8113583804dd72adc</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23377v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780344009</data>
