      <data key="d0">Neurosymbolic Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">architecture</data>
      <data key="d2">Neurosymbolic systems are a type of architecture used in machine learning that can satisfy logical constraints during learning without achieving the intended concept-label correspondence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b661d44ac0479d8113583804dd72adc</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23377v1</data>
