      <data key="d0">Deltas(Rho=0)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The DeltaS(rho=0) refers to a specific statistical measure used to quantify the difference in performance between GSAR and other grounding-evaluation frameworks on certain tasks or metrics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d0377df6ea4a3c4d53fdf21fda1a230f</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23366v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780344998</data>
      <data key="d6" />
