      <data key="d0">Evidence-Typed Scoring</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Evidence-typed scoring refers to a method of evaluating the strength and relevance of evidence used in decision-making or diagnosis, often used in multi-agent LLMs.</data>
