    <node id="Explicit Compute Budget">
      <data key="d0">Explicit Compute Budget</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The explicit compute budget refers to a predetermined limit on the amount of computational resources that can be used by the grounding-evaluation framework, helping to ensure that it remains efficient and effective.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d0377df6ea4a3c4d53fdf21fda1a230f</data>
