    <node id="First-Published Groundedness Framework">
      <data key="d0">First-Published Groundedness Framework</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The first-published groundedness framework refers to GSAR's status as the first publicly available grounding-evaluation framework that combines evidence-typed scoring with tiered recovery under an explicit compute budget.</data>
