      <data key="d0">Five Design Claims</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The five design claims refer to the specific hypotheses or assertions made about GSAR's performance and effectiveness in addressing hallucination detection and recovery in multi-agent LLMs.</data>
