      <data key="d0">Multi-Step Tuning Process</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The training process of S^2IT is divided into three steps: Global Syntax-guided Extraction, Local Syntax-guided Classification, and Fine-grained Structural Tuning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7460eba8c45931fa1d37a0c8e3e04c61</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.23296v1</data>
