      <data key="d0">AR-LLM-SE</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">AR-LLM-SE refers to the emerging threat of Augmented Reality-based Large Language Model Social Engineering attacks, which pose a significant risk to real-world social interactions.</data>
