      <data key="d0">Adaptive Psychological Agent</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Adaptive Psychological Agent is another core innovation of PhySE that dynamically deploys distinct classes of psychological strategies based on target response, moving beyond static, handcrafted scripts.</data>
