      <data key="d0">VLM-Based SocialContext Training</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">VLM-Based SocialContext Training is a core innovation of PhySE that efficiently pre-trains a Visual Language Model with social-context data to enable rapid, on-the-fly profile generation.</data>
