    <node id="Patent Retrieval">
      <data key="d0">Patent Retrieval</data>
      <data key="d1">task</data>
      <data key="d2">Patent retrieval underpins critical decisions in innovation, examination, and IP strategy, yet progress has been hampered by the absence of benchmarks that reflect the diversity of real-world search scenarios.</data>
