    <node id="Constraint-Like Interpretation">
      <data key="d0">Constraint-Like Interpretation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The constraint-like interpretation of procedural process models treats each model as constraining the activities within that model, without imposing explicit execution requirements or limitations.</data>
