      <data key="d0">Probing Agents</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Probing Agents are controlled entities used in Superminds Test to evaluate collective intelligence across three tiers: joint reasoning, information synthesis, and basic interaction.</data>
