      <data key="d0">Onemancompany (Omc)</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">OneManCompany is a framework that elevates multi-agent systems to the organisational level by encapsulating skills, tools, and runtime configurations into portable agent identities called Talents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0efa4e30e78d96bd663e201097b71209</data>
