      <data key="d0">Structured Multi-Dimensional Evaluation Strategy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The structured multi-dimensional evaluation strategy is a method for mitigating SPB by reducing cognitive load and evaluating LLMs based on multiple dimensions.</data>
