    </node>
    <node id="Gestalt-Inspired Dataset">
      <data key="d0">Gestalt-Inspired Dataset</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The model is also validated on a Gestalt-inspired dataset of camouflaged rotating objects, recovering correct 3D structure from motion and thereby accurate 2D object segmentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a796b36576b3a3580d3e19194a2554bd</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22160v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780396128</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Human Visual Perception">
      <data key="d0">Human Visual Perception</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Human visual perception offers valuable insights for understanding computational principles of motion-based scene interpretation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a796b36576b3a3580d3e19194a2554bd</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22160v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780396132</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Naturalistic Rgb Videos">
      <data key="d0">Naturalistic Rgb Videos</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The model tracks the moving 3D matter that makes up deforming objects in naturalistic RGB videos, enabling robust object-level scene understanding.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a796b36576b3a3580d3e19194a2554bd</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22160v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780396132</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Particles">
      <data key="d0">Particles</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Particles are small Gaussians representing local matter and are grouped into clusters capturing coherently and independently moveable physical entities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a796b36576b3a3580d3e19194a2554bd</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22160v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780396136</data>
