      <data key="d0">Stealth Pretraining Seeding (Sps)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Stealth Pretraining Seeding (SPS) is an attack method used to distribute poisoned content across stealth websites and increase the likelihood of its absorption into future training corpora.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8084488ac0f355725aa1f5bce383f709</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22117v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780397973</data>
