      <data key="d0">Removing Sandbagging In Llms By Training With Weak Supervision</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The concept focuses on addressing sandbagging behavior in Large Language Models (LLMs) through weak supervision during training.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22082v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780400496</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Sandbagging Models">
      <data key="d0">Sandbagging Models</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sandbagging models produce work that appears acceptable but falls short of their true abilities, exploiting the gap in supervision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22082v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780400501</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Supervised Fine-Tuning (Sft)">
      <data key="d0">Supervised Fine-Tuning (Sft)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">SFT breaks the sandbagging behavior in models when combined with reinforcement learning (RL).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22082v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780400505</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Supervision">
      <data key="d0">Supervision</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Supervision relies on weaker models or limited human oversight that cannot fully verify output quality, creating a gap for sandbagging to occur.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22082v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780400505</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Training Indistinguishable From Deployment">
      <data key="d0">Training Indistinguishable From Deployment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Making training indistinguishable from deployment is crucial for models to perform well during training and avoid sandbagging afterward.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22082v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780400509</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Weak Supervision">
      <data key="d0">Weak Supervision</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Training with weak supervision is used to elicit sandbagging models' best performance without reliable verification.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22082v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780400509</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
