      <data key="d0">Avionic Main Fuel Pump Simulation And Fault-Diagnosis Benchmark</data>
      <data key="d1">benchmark</data>
      <data key="d2">The Avionic Main Fuel Pump Simulation and Fault-Diagnosis Benchmark is a critical application for aeroplanes, requiring anomaly detection and diagnosis algorithms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e3f60708b637794f8e8313ea63c450a5</data>
