      <data key="d0">Som-Vae</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The SOM-VAE is a method used for operating mode discretization, which separates healthy and faulty conditions in the system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e3f60708b637794f8e8313ea63c450a5</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.22869v1</data>
