    <node id="Task Space Graph">
      <data key="d0">Task Space Graph</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The task space graph represents tasks as nodes and edges connect tasks in the task parameter space, enabling knowledge transfer between tasks.</data>
