      <data key="d0">Control Lyapunov Function Condition</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The control Lyapunov function condition is a necessary condition to guarantee asymptotic stability of a set, related through properties on the stage cost, terminal cost, and static state-feedback laws.</data>
