      <data key="d0">Agent Scaffolds</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Agent scaffolds are used in conjunction with LLMs to reproduce results from papers.&lt;SEP&gt;Agent scaffolds are used in agentic AI-assisted software development.</data>
