      <data key="d0">Agentic Reproduction System</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The system extracts structured methods descriptions from papers, runs reimplementations under strict information isolation, and enables deterministic comparison of reproduced outputs to original results.</data>
