      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scale-Adaptive Framework is a method that reuses the same architecture across different super-resolution factors by decomposing spatiotemporal SR into a deterministic prediction of the conditional mean and a residual conditional diffusion model.</data>
