      <data key="d0">Decoupled Representation Learning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Decoupled representation learning is a technique used in the proposed paradigm to decouple degradation and content representations by exploiting the content invariance between reference and distorted images.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-21ef2236051318a940ef23de1b45258a</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.21654v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780440456</data>
