      <data key="d0">Shapley Value</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Shapley value is a concept in game theory used to allocate the contribution of each player in a cooperative game.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07c4e7a4f2a8090be70ffa68d5ac787e</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.21537v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780446292</data>
