      <data key="d0">Stochastic Hill Climbing Metaheuristic</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A Stochastic Hill Climbing metaheuristic is a method used to find near-optimal solutions by iteratively perturbing the current solution.</data>
