    <node id="Knowledge Distillation Method">
      <data key="d0">Knowledge Distillation Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The knowledge distillation method presented in the paper is a novel approach that utilizes textual user profiles generated by pre-trained LLMs into sequential recommenders without requiring LLM inference at serving time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-68cd9de00c57319e6a29cb0cb1c01168</data>
