      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">Deductive ASPIC$^{\ominus}$ is a novel framework that integrates gen-rebuttals from ASPIC$^{\ominus}$ with the Joint Support Bipolar Argumentation Frameworks (JSBAFs) of Deductive ASPIC$-$, incorporating preferences.</data>
