    <node id="Varestorer">
      <data key="d0">Varestorer</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">VARestorer is a one-step image super-resolution model that transforms a pre-trained text-to-image VAR model into an ISR model, leveraging distribution matching and pyramid image conditioning with cross-scale attention.</data>
