      <data key="d0">Cluster Segregation Concealment (Csc)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">CSC is a method for detecting and suppressing backdoor attacks on deep neural networks by segregating poisoned samples through feature extraction, DBSCAN clustering, and identification of anomalous clusters based on class diversity and density metrics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16e1942c6343c62dd06a2dcfcadbb982</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.21416v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780451851</data>
