      <data key="d0">Cross-Entropy Loss</data>
      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Cross-entropy loss is a metric used in the concealment stage of CSC to fine-tune the model's classifier and replace the backdoor association with a benign virtual linkage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16e1942c6343c62dd06a2dcfcadbb982</data>
      <data key="d4">2604.21416v1</data>
      <data key="d5">1780451851</data>
