    <node id="Bongard-Logo">
      <data key="d0">Bongard-Logo</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">Bongard-LOGO is a synthetic benchmark for abstract concept learning with ground-truth generative programs, used in this paper to evaluate the performance of VLMs and LLMs.</data>
