      <data key="d0">Test-Time Reinforcement Learning (Ttrl)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">TTRL adapts models at inference time via pseudo-labeling, making it vulnerable to spurious optimization signals from label noise.</data>
