    <edge source="Agent Viability Framework" target="Aubin'S Viability Theory">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Agent Viability Framework is based on Aubin's viability theory, providing a theoretical foundation for AI agent safety and viability.&lt;SEP&gt;Aubin's viability theory provides the theoretical foundation for the Agent Viability Framework, establishing conditions for AI agent safety and viability.</data>
