    <edge source="Agent Viability Framework" target="Riskgate">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">RiskGate instantiates the Agent Viability Framework with dedicated statistical estimators, a fail-secure monotonic pipeline, and a closed-loop Autopilot formalised as an instance of Aubin's regulation map with kill-switch-as-last-resort.</data>
      <data key="d9">instantiation,tool application</data>
