    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent Viability Framework" target="Viability Index">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Viability Index $VI(t) \in [-1,+1]$ is used in the Agent Viability Framework to predict AI agent viability at time $t$ and transform governance from reactive to predictive.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agent Viability Framework uses the Viability Index $VI(t) \in [-1,+1]$ to predict AI agent viability at time $t$ and transform governance from reactive to predictive.</data>
