    <edge source="Deployment-Aligned Low-Precision Training" target="Fp16 Numerical Constraints">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Deployment-aligned low-precision training uses FP16 numerical constraints during fine-tuning and evaluation for joint optimization of architectural efficiency and numerical robustness.</data>
      <data key="d9">method application,numerical robustness</data>
