    </edge>
    <edge source="Full-Precision Assumptions" target="Hardware-Aware Optimization">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Hardware-aware optimization can lead to a mismatch between optimization-time behavior and deployment-time execution on low-precision hardware due to full-precision assumptions.</data>
      <data key="d9">concept limitation,mismatch</data>
