    </edge>
    <edge source="Adaptime Method" target="Temporal Reasoning Actions">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The AdapTime method dynamically executes temporal reasoning steps based on input context through the three actions: reformulate, rewrite, and review.</data>
      <data key="d9">application,execution</data>
