    </edge>
    <edge source="Concept Bottleneck Models" target="Credence">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">CREDENCE is a CBM framework that decomposes concept uncertainty by construction and represents each concept as a credal prediction (a probability interval).</data>
      <data key="d9">decomposition,framework-improvement</data>
