    <edge source="Priority Paygo" target="Provisioned Throughput">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cost analysis places both pay-per-token tiers well below the price of a STEM textbook per student per semester under a worst-case usage ceiling, and Provisioned Throughput becomes cost-competitive for institutions that can predict and concentrate their traffic toward high utilization.&lt;SEP&gt;Provisioned Throughput becomes cost-competitive for institutions that can predict and concentrate their traffic toward high utilization compared to Priority PayGo.</data>
      <data key="d9">cost analysis,dataset comparison</data>
