      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">State-of-the-art large language models were evaluated on their ability to predict empirically supported causal directions in ideology-contested cases using the EconCausal benchmark.&lt;SEP&gt;The EconCausal benchmark is used to evaluate the ability of state-of-the-art large language models to predict empirically supported causal directions in ideology-contested cases.</data>
