    <edge source="Constitutional Prompting" target="Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF)">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) and Constitutional Prompting are methods that operate primarily at the model level and provide only probabilistic safety guarantees.&lt;SEP&gt;Constitutional Prompting and Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) are methods that operate primarily at the model level and provide only probabilistic safety guarantees.</data>
      <data key="d9">method comparison,safety guarantees</data>
