    </edge>
    <edge source="Intent Lineage Tracking (Ilt)" target="Pea Architecture">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Intent Lineage Tracking (ILT) is part of the PEA architecture and binds all executable intents to the originating user request via cryptographic anchors.</data>
      <data key="d9">method implementation,system transparency</data>
