      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Output Semantic Gate (OSG) and Intent Verification Layer (IVL) are methods that contribute to maintaining goal integrity in AI systems by detecting implicit coercion and ensuring capability-intent consistency.</data>
