    <edge source="Output Semantic Gate (Osg)" target="Pea Architecture">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Output Semantic Gate (OSG) is part of the PEA architecture and detects implicit coercion using a structured $K \times I \times P$ threat calculus (Knowledge, Influence, Policy).</data>
      <data key="d9">method implementation,system safety</data>
