    <edge source="Design Playbook" target="Expectations Management (Em)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Expectations Management Design Playbook is a five-phase design tool that supports moral prudence in smart-home design and provides guidance for human-centred AI.</data>
