    <edge source="Design Tensions" target="Expectations Management (Em)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Expectations Management differs from expectation-confirmation theory and trust-calibration by foregrounding moral judgement, situated action, and cross-cultural variation is a more detailed description of the relation.</data>
