    <edge source="Additive-Kernel Viewpoint" target="Standard Gaussian Kan (Gkan)">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Additive-kernel viewpoint is a formulation of both the standard Gaussian KAN (GKAN) and PU-GKAN from a finite-feature perspective.&lt;SEP&gt;The Standard Gaussian KAN is also formulated from a finite-feature perspective using the Additive-kernel viewpoint.</data>
      <data key="d9">formulation perspective,model component,model variant</data>
