      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Shepard-Type Normalized Gaussian KAN has an explicit finite-feature kernel interpretation and is formulated from a finite-feature perspective using the Additive-kernel viewpoint.&lt;SEP&gt;The Additive-kernel viewpoint is also a formulation of the Shepard-Type Normalized Gaussian KAN from a finite-feature perspective.</data>
      <data key="d9">formulation perspective,model component,model variant</data>
