      <data key="d8">Propagated uncertainty signals are transformed from uncertainty signals across different stages and components of an LLM-based system.&lt;SEP&gt;An uncertainty signal is transformed into a propagated uncertainty signal across different stages and components of an LLM-based system.</data>
