    <edge source="Active Inference" target="Phenotyping Agency">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Active Inference is a method for characterizing agency in AI systems using three criteria: intentionality, rationality, and explainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Phenotyping Agency is a concept that Active Inference aims to characterize in AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d9">agency characterization,method application</data>
