    <edge source="Physe" target="VLM-Based SocialContext Training">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">VLM-Based SocialContext Training is a core innovation of PhySE that enables rapid, on-the-fly profile generation through efficient pre-training of a Visual Language Model.&lt;SEP&gt;Physe incorporates VLM-Based SocialContext Training as a core innovation for rapid, on-the-fly profile generation.</data>
