      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The SKR adaptation method is evaluated using the MMDocRAG dataset and demonstrates substantial improvements in information retrieval tasks, object detection latency, and anomaly detection AUPRC.&lt;SEP&gt;The SKR adaptation method surpasses leading retrieval models on the MMDocRAG dataset by at least 12.6% in terms of performance.</data>
