    <edge source="Agentic World Modeling" target="Levels X Laws Taxonomy">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Agentic World Modeling uses the Levels x Laws Taxonomy as its underlying framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Levels x Laws Taxonomy is used in Agentic World Modeling to organize the framework along two axes: capability levels and governing-law regimes.</data>
