    <edge source="Attestation" target="Reconstructive Authority Model (Ram)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Reconstructive Authority Model proves adequacy of what is measured and separates integrity from coverage, addressing the limitations of attestation alone.</data>
