    <edge source="Attestation-Based Systems" target="Reconstructive Authority Model (Ram)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Comparing attestation-based systems to the Reconstructive Authority Model shows that the latter achieves significantly better results in terms of invalid execution rates.</data>
