    <edge source="Cryptographic Attestation" target="Reconstructive Authority Model (Ram)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Reconstructive Authority Model separates integrity from coverage, addressing the structural insufficiency of existing governance mechanisms like Cryptographic Attestation.</data>
