    <edge source="AI-Augmented Business Process Management System (ABPMS)" target="Abpms Process Frame">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The ABPMS process frame provides a hybrid business process representation that gives the system process-awareness and defines the boundaries in which it must operate.</data>
      <data key="d9">hybrid representation,process-awareness</data>
