    <edge source="Model Organisms" target="Supervision">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Model organisms are trained to exhibit sandbagging behavior due to the gap created by weaker models or limited human oversight in supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;Weaker models or limited human oversight in supervision create a gap for model organisms to exploit and exhibit sandbagging behavior.</data>
