    <edge source="Certification Framework" target="Publication System">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">This paper proposes a two-layer certification framework that separates knowledge quality assessment from grading of human contribution, allowing publication systems to handle pipeline-generated work consistently and transparently.</data>
      <data key="d9">framework relationship,publication system</data>
