    </edge>
    <edge source="Publication System" target="Rethinking Publication: A Certification Framework for AI-Enabled Research">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">This paper proposes a two-layer certification framework that separates knowledge quality assessment from grading of human contribution, allowing publication systems to handle pipeline-generated work consistently and transparently.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication system was built on the assumption of universal human authorship and lacks a principled way to evaluate knowledge produced through automated pipelines.</data>
      <data key="d9">paper,paper relationship,publication system,system relationship</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f92416ce1ab40a1abd7e32f118a086c3</data>
      <data key="d11">2604.22026v1</data>
      <data key="d12">1780404728</data>
