      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Temporal super-resolution transforms low-FPS videos from the slow-motion dataset into high-FPS sequences with fine-grained temporal details.&lt;SEP&gt;The slow-motion video dataset is used to train temporal super-resolution models for enhancing low-FPS videos.</data>
