      <data key="d8">Speed-conditioned video generation and temporal super-resolution are combined to produce motion at specified playback speeds in videos.&lt;SEP&gt;Temporal super-resolution enhances speed-conditioned video generation by transforming low-FPS videos into high-FPS sequences with fine-grained temporal details.</data>
