      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Uncertainty-aware exploration alters fairness metrics by accounting for the uneven distribution of model uncertainty across groups.</data>
      <data key="d9">fairness metrics,uncertainty-aware exploration</data>
