    <edge source="Sequential Decisions" target="Uncertainty In Sequential Decision-Making">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Many real ML applications are online and sequential, with prior decisions informing future ones, and this paper introduces a taxonomy of uncertainty in sequential decision-making.</data>
      <data key="d9">sequential decision-making,uncertainty taxonomy</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-fe7fc82733330af762752cd6e70c474d</data>
