    </edge>
    <edge source="Sequential Decisions" target="Taxonomy Of Uncertainty">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A taxonomy of uncertainty in sequential decision-making provides a shared vocabulary for assessing systems where uncertainty is unevenly distributed across groups, including many real ML applications that are online and sequential.</data>
      <data key="d9">sequential decision-making,uncertainty taxonomy</data>
