    <edge source="BERT-small" target="Geometric Monomial (Gem)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Geometric Monomial (GEM) is evaluated on BERT-small and shows a significant improvement in validation loss compared to other activation functions.</data>
