    <edge source="E-Gem" target="Geometric Monomial (Gem)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">E-GEM is an ε-parameterized generalization of the Geometric Monomial (GEM) that enables arbitrary L^p-approximation of ReLU.</data>
      <data key="d9">variant relationship,ε-parameterization</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-a0f9d8ef8dcee4b84c3e9529d0d4d52a</data>
