    <edge source="GPT-2 (124M)" target="Geometric Monomial (Gem)">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Geometric Monomial (GEM) is evaluated on GPT-2 (124M) and shows a significant reduction in perplexity compared to GELU.</data>
