    <edge source="Geometric Monomial (Gem)" target="Se-Gem">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">SE-GEM is a piecewise variant of the Geometric Monomial (GEM) that eliminates dead neurons with C^{2N} junction smoothness.</data>
