      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Deductive ASPIC$^{\ominus}$ integrates gen-rebuttals from ASPIC$^{\ominus}$ with the Joint Support Bipolar Argumentation Frameworks (JSBAFs) of Deductive ASPIC$-$.&lt;SEP&gt;ASPIC-style Structured Argumentation Frameworks provide a formal basis for reasoning in artificial intelligence by combining internal argument structure with abstract argumentation semantics and integrate gen-rebuttals from ASPIC$^{\ominus}$.</data>
