      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Deductive ASPIC$-$ has made significant progress in ensuring compliance with rationality postulates and incorporates preferences.&lt;SEP&gt;ASPIC-style Structured Argumentation Frameworks provide a formal basis for reasoning in artificial intelligence by combining internal argument structure with abstract argumentation semantics and integrate gen-rebuttals from Deductive ASPIC$-$.</data>
      <data key="d9">extension,improvement,integration</data>
