      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">ASPIC-style Structured Argumentation Frameworks provide a formal basis for reasoning in artificial intelligence by combining internal argument structure with abstract argumentation semantics and satisfy some rationality postulates.</data>
