    <edge source="Dynamical Prior Reinforcement Learning (Dp-Rl)" target="Policy Gradient Learning">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">DP-RL augments policy gradient learning with an auxiliary loss derived from external state dynamics to shape the temporal evolution of action probabilities during learning.</data>
