    <edge source="Dynamical Prior Reinforcement Learning (Dp-Rl)" target="Temporal Geometry Of Decision-Making">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The dynamical priors in DP-RL promote temporally structured behavior that cannot be explained by generic smoothing and control the temporal geometry of decision-making in RL agents.</data>
